tion><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/tOfRiaYvR9icAuaZLp0gGrB1bJVQGZFJ6lY45MibIrdUlNrUWVn8BVmo9fjwPbp3XX4G13MWRS8GXDu4iaNr4UuOlBzjib3pwhBLwUuKGBe1EX88/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/tOfRiaYvR9icAuaZLp0gGrB1bJVQGZFJ6lY45MibIrdUlNrUWVn8BVmo9fjwPbp3XX4G13MWRS8GXDu4iaNr4UuOlBzjib3pwhBLwUuKGBe1EX88/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.具有良好的政治素质和思想道德素养，政治立场坚定，德、智、体、美、劳全面发展，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.对马克思主义理论、党史党建及相关学科具有浓厚的兴趣，有较强专业理论基础和良好的科研潜力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.申请者为马克思主义理论、思想政治教育、党史党建等相关专业的大二、大三年级本科生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.学习成绩优秀，获得校级及以上奖学金或目前成绩排名在年级前50%；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.无任何学术不端行为及违法违纪等受处分记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.英语四级考试成绩达425分及以上。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><sect